creature Crop
  traits
    growth_stage is a number
    is_harvested is true or false
  end traits

  when born
    give self the trait growth_stage to 0
    give self the trait is_harvested to false
  end born

  action water
    when self is_harvested == false
      give self the trait growth_stage to self growth_stage + 1
      say "Crop watered. Growth stage: " + self growth_stage
      when self growth_stage > 2
        say "The crop is fully grown and ready to harvest!"
      end when
    otherwise
      say "The crop is already harvested."
    end when
  end action

  action harvest
    when self is_harvested == false
      when self growth_stage > 2
        give self the trait is_harvested to true
        say "Crop successfully harvested!"
      otherwise
        say "Crop is not fully grown yet. Cannot harvest."
      end when
    otherwise
      say "Crop already harvested."
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring TomatoPlant to life as Crop

TomatoPlant does harvest
TomatoPlant does water
TomatoPlant does water
TomatoPlant does harvest
TomatoPlant does water
TomatoPlant does harvest
TomatoPlant does water
